WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.300
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
The precious arms

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
This love...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
Omoi wo

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:44.620
Open The Window

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.190
A child!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.630
Sister? Sister!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.190
It's okay. Don't cry.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.330
Kurau!

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:18.540
Leticia!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.870
Sister!

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:21.620
Leticia!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.370
Christmas! Take those girls outside.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.610
O-okay! This way, hurry!

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.750
Okay!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.750
Why are you doing such a thing, Kurau?

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.880
We finally meet,

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.210
yet you occupy yourself with
such trivial matters.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.550
Trivial matters?

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.260
Why are YOU doing such things?!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:47.270
Don't you understand your powers
can hurt or even kill people?

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.260
What are you talking about?

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.300
You disappoint us, Kurau.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.730
We've been listening to your voice all along.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:56.900
My voice?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.070
You're the one who called us.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.660
I never called you...

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:06.240
The joy you felt in coming to this wide world was conveyed to us.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.120
You called us...

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.030
Kurau!

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.730
...To fly freely around this wide world!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.230
Kurau!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.100
It's Doug. I'll be there shortly.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.190
Have those two come back from their trip yet?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.740
Well the thing is, the train they were on was in an accident.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.820
What?!

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:42.910
Kurau called us when they left Marseilles.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:47.740
But Ayaka just called and said she's lost contact with Kurau.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:51.170
Do you know what time Kurau's train left?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.040
It left Marseilles at 9:10.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.840
It's already crossed the border by now.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.050
Don't worry! I'll go pick them up.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.820
I... called them?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.490
Are you okay?

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.490
I'm fine.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.650
But... it gave me the chills.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.580
When his hand touched me, it felt so cold...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.450
Cold...

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.500
I felt that too.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.420
Christmas, hide here, okay?

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.260
But...

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.950
it's okay. I'm just going to go see what's going on.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.050
I'll come back right away if I think it's dangerous.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.260
Okay...

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.170
I've been looking for you two.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.790
I want to help you.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.140
Help?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.870
The GPO is after you, aren't they?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.710
If you cause trouble like this,
they'll find you right away.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.550
Are you still talking nonsense like that?

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.510
Don't you care if you get caught?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.010
There's no way humans can capture us!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:33.220
You just don't know! You've only
just come into this world.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.870
Kurau, I wish you would stop this
meaningless chatter...

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:49.320
In the Rynax world, your voice echoed so beautifully...

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:54.290
Why? What can I say to make you understand?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.430
Stop it!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.440
Kurau!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.160
Kurau's all beaten up.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.340
Yeah, all beaten up.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:49.810
We can make all the Rynax pour out of Kurau.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.100
I... I won't let you do such a thing!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.510
But we're going to.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:59.060
If you do that... many people will die. And Rynax too!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.440
Die?

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.730
Can't you hear it?

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.780
The voices of the Rynax!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:09.820
Listen to what I'm saying!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.530
Come on, let's make the Rynax pour out!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.740
Kurau!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.080
What?!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.840
Kurau!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.840
Christmas!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:41.850
You okay, Windt?

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:43.940
Yeah.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.730
How about you, Regel?

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:47.650
I'm fine.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.820
That girl's hand...

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.820
It was as hot as fire...

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.620
What a wondrous thing it is. The human body...

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.440
We almost had her.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.420
Yeah, almost.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.290
But... No matter where she runs to,
we'll find them right away.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.190
Yes, after all, they're Rynax too.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.350
Kurau... Are you okay?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.350
Sorry, Christmas...

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.930
You must've been scared.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.730
I'm fine. I was so focused on the moment.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.480
But those two tried to...

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:34.820
I'm fine. But if things go on like this,
the GPO will find them...

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.830
Kurau...

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.310
What is it?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.750
Kurau... I'm here for you, okay?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.670
Christmas...

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.090
You're so warm...

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.560
Thank you. I'm okay now.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.810
Really?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.560
Yeah. I feel like my body's gotten lighter.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.490
Kurau, let's go home.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:14.740
Okay.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.620
Give me a hand!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.630
It's dangerous! Stay away!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.420
There are people trapped inside.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.340
Give us a hand!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:32.210
Are you all right?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.090
What on Earth happened here?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.600
It's a complete mess.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.560
Is this the power of a Rynax?

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:45.580
It can't be...

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.810
There was this golden glow.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:54.280
Two men with a golden glow...
Picked up the train... And...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.490
They're monsters!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.910
Those guys are monsters! Monsters!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.430
Kurau! Christmas!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.680
Doug!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.890
It's Doug!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.310
I'm so glad I found you!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.440
Jeez, you just can't stop
making me worry, can you?!

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.960
I heard the train had stopped

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.750
so I rushed down and saw the mess...

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:56.260
Was that done by the Rynax twins too?

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.260
Yeah...

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:03.550
Rynax... What the hell are they?
Why are they doing this?

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:07.770
Those two are just playing.
They're just getting a kick out of it.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.610
They have no idea what they're doing. Just like children...

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.150
That's probably why they're being so reckless.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.110
We have to do something!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.820
Do something? Like what?!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.450
Even you're powerless against them, right?

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:22.910
But...

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.200
Aren't they after you?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:30.830
You said they're trying to pour
out the Rynax from your body, right?

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.330
Maybe it's better if you hide.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.790
But...

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:41.010
Why on Earth do these twins want to
pour the Rynax out of your body?

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.140
Into the wide world...

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.220
Huh?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:49.850
The joy you felt in coming to this wide world was conveyed to us.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.940
...To fly freely around this wide world!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:59.280
What if... something had changed
because I came into this world?

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.040
I thought I wanted to help those two.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.250
But maybe that was a mistake...

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.550
Kurau...

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.600
What the twins have done is unforgivable.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:31.560
But they were the subjects of a
GPO Rynax experiment.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.980
You were not mistaken in wanting to help them.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.530
That's how I feel.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.490
Ayaka's on her way over here now.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.280
She was terribly worried about you and Christmas.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:07.800
Doug?

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:12.930
What's up?

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.810
You looked really scary just now.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.440
O-oh yeah?

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.190
Yeah...

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.690
Really?

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:23.860
It's nothing.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.570
I was just thinking about Ted.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.240
About Ted?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:29.700
Yeah.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.010
You're not going to call him today?

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.840
Huh? Uh, no... Not today.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:35.980
You sure?

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:41.210
Yeah... I already called him today
so I'll call him again tomorrow.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.130
Tomorrow, again...

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.680
Christmas!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.720
Come upstairs. I have something nice for you.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.310
Something nice?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:57.100
Go on. Or that something nice will run away!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.900
What?

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.560
Coming!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:07.200
An advent calendar. I bought it just for you.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.410
It's so cute!

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.310
Well, you know, it's almost Christmas.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.200
Almost... Christmas?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:19.420
Oh. That's right. You don't know what that is...

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.840
it's the name Kurau gave me.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.760
A word that warms the heart.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.510
Right... That's right.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:46.530
When December comes, you open one window at a time.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.250
This is the last window.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:52.910
You open it on Christmas Eve so that you'll
be ready to receive the joy of Christmas.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.540
To receive the joy...

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.410
Christmas Day...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:05.170
You pray that happiness will come
to everyone in the family.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.090
Pray for happiness...

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:07.800
Yes!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.300
Such a warm feeling...

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.800
Yes, that's right...

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:28.000
Ai wo maku you ni korogatte ikiru
Rolling along, as though sowing love, it lives

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:40.960
Motomete ita yume wa nani
What kind of dream was I searching for?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:51.500
Sora ni mukatte tou
I look at the sky and ask the question

00:15:53.950 --> 00:16:01.830
Jiyuu dakedo kodoku wa iya
I am free but don't want to be lonely

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.400
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:12.110
Lonely freedom

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.960
Yeah, it sure is.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:08.660
Shall we make it more beautiful?

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:22.510
Lonely freedom

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:33.060
Lonely freedom

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.060
You know, Windt.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.300
If we get all beaten up,

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.690
I wonder if the Rynax will pour out of us too.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.860
That's not bad either.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.860
But we finally made it into this world.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.440
I'd hate to be destroyed.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.780
That should be Kurau's job.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.370
That's true.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:01.700
I'm tired. Let's rest somewhere, Regel.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.410
Sure.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.350
Ayaka!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.400
I just got into Switzerland.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:25.100
I heard there was a huge accident last night and the cause is unknown.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.730
Last night?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.610
I don't know the details yet.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.440
But it was probably caused by the Rynax.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.610
What have the twins done?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.350
I'll go check it out.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:38.350
I'll go too. Where are you?

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.780
You mustn't come!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:44.560
Commissioner Saito has issued an order
to the twins to find you.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:48.340
Those two aren't acting on orders.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.960
You mean, they're acting on that Rynax will you talked about before?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.170
That's right. The Rynax will...

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:56.720
But that's...

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:12.820
That's... far more dangerous than I had imagined.

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:32.920
Doug...

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.800
Yo!

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:45.640
Candles in the river?

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:49.350
Apparently, it's an old town custom.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.230
It takes place every year before Christmas.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.650
And that's why there was a large crowd here.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.820
There were many victims.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:06.290
The local GPO was in total chaos,
not knowing what was going on.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.710
No one knows exactly how many
people disappeared.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:13.790
Since they all disappeared...

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:31.230
Ayaka... Have you been chasing this kind of Ryna sapiens all along?

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.190
Are Ryna sapiens really this dangerous?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.490
Stop teasing me, Doug.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.160
It's not that. I'm not blaming you.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.780
What should I do, Ayaka?

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.580
I'm no match for these guys.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.960
I can't help Kurau and Christmas.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.210
What am I supposed to do?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:00.840
Doug...

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.730
That's...

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:23.030
They trampled on the daily lives of the people here.

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:37.210
I'm returning those Rynax twins
back to the world they came from!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:42.050
Was that...

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.140
They were there just now!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:50.440
Hey!

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.430
Wait!

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.290
Ayaka! We're going after them!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.320
What? What's wrong?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.700
"We're going after them," huh?

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.280
My body just started moving on its own!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.930
Ayaka! Let's go!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:11.660
Hey...

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:14.210
Jeez, what's with him...

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.840
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.840
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:56.180
You smile at me

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:56.180
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:05.320
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:05.320
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:14.400
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:14.400
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:23.640
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:23.640
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.750
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.750
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

